-Dsbt.io.implicit.relative.glob.conversion=allow
-J-Xmx8G
# The Scala 3 compiler recurses deeply through the staging/inline phases
# (CrossStageSafety + TreeMapWithImplicits) on shared/, and the JVM default
# thread stack is not enough: Netlify's build (JDK 11) died with a
# StackOverflowError compiling shared/.js while the same sources build fine on
# JDK 17/21. -Xmx does NOT help a stack overflow — this is the knob that does.
-J-Xss8m
